<title>INDONESIA: Putra Surya 1996 net up to 65.54 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Putra Surya 1996 net up to 65.54 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			65.54 vs  56.28</p>
<p>    Revenues			 466.44 vs 345.96</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   187.00 vs 211.61</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     127.50 vs 146.22</p>
<p>    Profit before income tax    91.44 vs  80.77</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     81.76 vs 115.96</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were audited. PT Putra Surya Perkasa is a medium-sized property firm.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
